---
import BaseLayout from '@kedoupi/shared/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../../styles/blog.css';
const title = '博客';
const description = '整理完成的公开表达：围绕个人数字空间、健康、投资与内容工作的观察与记录。';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} pathname="/blog/" schemaType="WebPage">
  <div class="blog-page">
    <header class="blog-header">
      <span class="blog-eyebrow">02 / 思考与沉淀</span>
      <h1 class="blog-title">真实想法，<br /><em>慢慢整理成文。</em></h1>
      <p class="blog-lead">不追求高频发表，也不迎合算法分发。围绕健康与睡眠、资本与决策、私域智能与生活实践，把每一次值得回看的思考沉淀下来。</p>
      <div class="blog-tags" aria-label="写作方向"><span class="blog-tag">深度思考</span><span class="blog-tag">确信的经验</span><span class="blog-tag">真实复盘</span><span class="blog-tag">长期主义</span></div>
    </header>
    <section id="blog-list-mount" class="blog-list" hidden aria-label="文章列表"></section>
    <section class="blog-empty-pavilion" aria-label="文章整理中">
      <div class="blog-empty-hero">
        <div class="blog-status-pill"><span class="pulse-dot"></span>正在整理</div>
        <h2 class="blog-empty-title">思考在日常里发生，在时间中沉淀</h2>
        <p class="blog-empty-desc">这里不会放未经推敲的碎片或占位草稿。只有经过真实生活检验、具备长期连接价值的观察与总结，才会梳理成篇公开发布。</p>
        <div class="blog-topics-grid"><div class="topic-card"><span class="topic-num">01</span><span class="topic-tag">健康与睡眠</span><h3 class="topic-title">让身体成为可理解的数据</h3><p class="topic-desc">记录长期观察与真实复盘。</p></div><div class="topic-card"><span class="topic-num">02</span><span class="topic-tag">资本与决策</span><h3 class="topic-title">在不确定性中保持判断</h3><p class="topic-desc">整理确信的经验和决策过程。</p></div><div class="topic-card"><span class="topic-num">03</span><span class="topic-tag">私域智能</span><h3 class="topic-title">让工具服务于真实生活</h3><p class="topic-desc">探索个人数字空间的长期连接。</p></div></div>
        <div class="blog-quote-block"><p class="blog-quote-text">“值得公开的，不是发生过什么，而是从中确认了什么。”</p></div>
        <p class="blog-empty-note">所有正式文章均发布于 codepi.app 主域名内，支持全文检索与 CodePi MCP 结构化只读接口。</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
